[{:db/id "q-73712/selection/69e2c53f2315bcc297c35732b1c795d6b13b6c4dc6b12f1d0016d7e0957d4f2b" :answer/id #uuid "c3587aac-e2c7-570c-b0c8-5d9c40e9811e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73712/selection/72a72c6593f93ba08b27b50c8861af8afc95142cea0fd71b1662fd99818686ca" :answer/id #uuid "ac620c10-f521-5ff3-8b4f-b70b607db43c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73712/selection/7a801a2ac6c6bec0536402679341c9f21d6ddf04b640bba9d4b51655759cb7eb" :answer/id #uuid "250373ad-04fb-5674-bdcc-07079672e586" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73712/selection/f247c1ab3a1f966b0211aca91657a2e730afa603a2eae651d1f5242673fa5c16" :answer/id #uuid "56a6922a-5caa-5eb4-a801-d14114a20f17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73712/selection/1a6ed7990b1f1cbe217c3a6f433124cef92afef2e12a8aabb67a477cdb9fd55e" :answer/id #uuid "ae7ad0b5-0f5d-51ec-80e0-4c5e74c097c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73712/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "674e39a4-d87d-57f7-812f-16c60879dddb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73712/selection/7a801a2ac6c6bec0536402679341c9f21d6ddf04b640bba9d4b51655759cb7eb" :answer-field/choices ["q-73712/selection/69e2c53f2315bcc297c35732b1c795d6b13b6c4dc6b12f1d0016d7e0957d4f2b" "q-73712/selection/72a72c6593f93ba08b27b50c8861af8afc95142cea0fd71b1662fd99818686ca" "q-73712/selection/7a801a2ac6c6bec0536402679341c9f21d6ddf04b640bba9d4b51655759cb7eb" "q-73712/selection/f247c1ab3a1f966b0211aca91657a2e730afa603a2eae651d1f5242673fa5c16" "q-73712/selection/1a6ed7990b1f1cbe217c3a6f433124cef92afef2e12a8aabb67a477cdb9fd55e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73712" :question/id #uuid "8c1e95af-d9b3-56dc-a410-8e208dc56f66" :question/math-academy-id "q-73712" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{8}{3\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:   \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{3\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{8}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/4)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{2})}^{2}.$ \n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{2}.$ Differentiating, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=2\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\n \n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{3\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{4}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (2\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73712/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73712"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032/selection/90d8066cf53142174986027aae9e1f4ee0e641afe715c7801b090302daca7f12" :answer/id #uuid "de7379ac-edf1-5569-8713-27d0beec1603" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032/selection/154a3c57026ceb14c8aa31d56791dc65487aa7727084add978de9ae2e7583ba6" :answer/id #uuid "6b0c7cee-5881-5103-bd91-3df14f29b289" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032/selection/005898e3811dfacfa8820a751ad13e88b292043aa492f13077f4476e5d7bc928" :answer/id #uuid "06683b40-3991-5149-8a0a-86a938d43b3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{x})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032/selection/3e29e7126a43d0d093754100f68cd6e156c2aa2076311d965bcacaa2ca080fc5" :answer/id #uuid "98a5a131-b799-5b3b-a0a3-c57bf567eeab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032/selection/053327c31ddacc451a4af7162aec3c1f3bfb0a2246ae7e4937ab29ceca07e15a" :answer/id #uuid "9a3bf19e-e0ab-5cb9-90b1-f43021992e92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5d1f923a-4ff1-53c6-af71-81359ee48ab3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114032/selection/3e29e7126a43d0d093754100f68cd6e156c2aa2076311d965bcacaa2ca080fc5" :answer-field/choices ["q-114032/selection/90d8066cf53142174986027aae9e1f4ee0e641afe715c7801b090302daca7f12" "q-114032/selection/154a3c57026ceb14c8aa31d56791dc65487aa7727084add978de9ae2e7583ba6" "q-114032/selection/005898e3811dfacfa8820a751ad13e88b292043aa492f13077f4476e5d7bc928" "q-114032/selection/3e29e7126a43d0d093754100f68cd6e156c2aa2076311d965bcacaa2ca080fc5" "q-114032/selection/053327c31ddacc451a4af7162aec3c1f3bfb0a2246ae7e4937ab29ceca07e15a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114032" :question/id #uuid "7fa09994-b03e-519d-aa09-462602c3715d" :question/math-academy-id "q-114032" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1-3{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $3{x}^{2}=(\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{3}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1-3{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{3}}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114032/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114032"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535/selection/f1490909ad2a5da83196559ba4708c2948d6a9c3b42c6491ed3e6901b1048ac2" :answer/id #uuid "513fd128-3eaf-5542-affc-8da1c9604fc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535/selection/cd7c8f2420436bd8bb55c3db36ee9785a71c8d8daf033e0becfc84d6e39e0c4d" :answer/id #uuid "51fe00fb-90e9-5c18-b380-6ba59da0291a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(4x)}{4}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535/selection/9c9cc4e329d428f6d7250119f4c237ed81a01856b4e857d0ee88c11387b69cfd" :answer/id #uuid "eac18b02-26e7-5c93-ab5e-a640af123a5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{4}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535/selection/58ea0bb4f48b60a8ca9dfb7edecd58610ab90b0f65a3575537d04c32737bc8d5" :answer/id #uuid "ec106e93-cc17-596b-bb1d-905975e1eaaf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{2}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535/selection/7e47a3940f1b54adecb2e593514b301565fb50c775726edf25119ab2393c0071" :answer/id #uuid "6a13fdde-6217-5e84-992e-c20461d684fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)}{4}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "435e26b2-b932-5641-af4d-d48eb725fa47" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49535/selection/58ea0bb4f48b60a8ca9dfb7edecd58610ab90b0f65a3575537d04c32737bc8d5" :answer-field/choices ["q-49535/selection/f1490909ad2a5da83196559ba4708c2948d6a9c3b42c6491ed3e6901b1048ac2" "q-49535/selection/cd7c8f2420436bd8bb55c3db36ee9785a71c8d8daf033e0becfc84d6e39e0c4d" "q-49535/selection/9c9cc4e329d428f6d7250119f4c237ed81a01856b4e857d0ee88c11387b69cfd" "q-49535/selection/58ea0bb4f48b60a8ca9dfb7edecd58610ab90b0f65a3575537d04c32737bc8d5" "q-49535/selection/7e47a3940f1b54adecb2e593514b301565fb50c775726edf25119ab2393c0071"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49535" :question/id #uuid "d3cc9f37-e91e-5ae4-90cc-68725fe7b8a8" :question/math-academy-id "q-49535" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $16{x}^{2}=(4x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=4x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-49535/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49535"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114030/selection/65accef0e07a51ba7f34db0c444d9aea0793a88eebd7ed3149d4ffc1e4da1202" :answer/id #uuid "150f57bf-3e36-5795-b8dd-7f8d924537aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114030/selection/1f39bc88addde8d152bc7d181b25f474770a68f6caf3e9ac945a7a7327ffbf34" :answer/id #uuid "4b8a3275-2a3a-5283-92a3-5a3429d9d92b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{25}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114030/selection/581ab2c295a6ae544849e2da34eaa412f379095b2efb4ddc6736f105191dfdd4" :answer/id #uuid "03ebc035-5cdd-5d02-8738-0703aa5b130e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "25\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114030/selection/16079873eb8ac63d4211b7af8737e339831772945e4859e23d82dfe2f5055a00" :answer/id #uuid "1c321557-b8ab-599d-9637-eded56c518d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\