ratorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114045/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "227abe29-6e31-5afd-b0ca-3b8ed7d8c287"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114045"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056/selection/8d92cb5baf03eb4dd6f8c144de16a6f3b0a016792c818a713caa01a21c837b25" :answer/id #uuid "f25c85c8-cf4d-5a21-9f06-5dd705afcaa7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{8}}{8}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056/selection/cadad2ecdc4814209cd684a07f484b13e4db0ef88d5abfc7a0702353b729330d" :answer/id #uuid "cf01bf55-d339-5445-b4cb-46298db56091" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{8}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056/selection/ea7e94103bbef017f607557d707f896564055f2b4840dff0d5c03347cac91575" :answer/id #uuid "1088c4b9-da60-59cd-ab68-0910b963f941" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{8}})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056/selection/81078da36a7861f461476dd1bc6003bf1151667abb0da481da98c4df696e2949" :answer/id #uuid "c5407476-01e9-587f-9a84-f414950ff22c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\sqrt{8}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056/selection/d2203cf2ca4e52d4dfbe8f59b506bb2fdabd0d0b8ec689becf9fc63ad0d61d05" :answer/id #uuid "acde7078-c8ce-5bfb-b221-34f38c9d69bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{8}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3d2a1f62-e46f-5be2-a82f-01cd0ef0da50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114056/selection/d2203cf2ca4e52d4dfbe8f59b506bb2fdabd0d0b8ec689becf9fc63ad0d61d05" :answer-field/choices ["q-114056/selection/8d92cb5baf03eb4dd6f8c144de16a6f3b0a016792c818a713caa01a21c837b25" "q-114056/selection/cadad2ecdc4814209cd684a07f484b13e4db0ef88d5abfc7a0702353b729330d" "q-114056/selection/ea7e94103bbef017f607557d707f896564055f2b4840dff0d5c03347cac91575" "q-114056/selection/81078da36a7861f461476dd1bc6003bf1151667abb0da481da98c4df696e2949" "q-114056/selection/d2203cf2ca4e52d4dfbe8f59b506bb2fdabd0d0b8ec689becf9fc63ad0d61d05"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114056" :question/id #uuid "a33f4543-08d0-561d-b9e2-d065f565c833" :question/math-academy-id "q-114056" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{8\\sqrt{8}}{|\\sqrt{8}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{8}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{8}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{8}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{8\\sqrt{8}}{|\\sqrt{8}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{8}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{8}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =8\\,\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =8\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{8}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-114056/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8d18bdc7-9387-5b2d-98bd-015fa4a1eba7"] :knowledge-poi